<title>POLAND: ELEKTROBUDOWA AUG NET RISES TO PLN 1.3 MLN.</title>
<headline>ELEKTROBUDOWA AUG NET RISES TO PLN 1.3 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results August</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>AUGUST</p>
<p> Net profit	     1.34 vs   0.55</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 2.52 vs   0.96</p>
<p> Operating profit     2.72 vs   1.22</p>
<p> Sales		   19.43 vs  15.38</p>
<p>JANUARY-AUGUST</p>
<p> Net profit	    11.25 vs   6.75</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	19.47 vs  10.88</p>
<p> Operating profit    20.82 vs  12.69</p>
<p> Sales		  143.39 vs  99.20</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish construction company is</p>
<p>Elektrobudowa SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
